/* The flagship of $gymChain.name, open once The Gym Meeting is done (setup.gymUnlocked, Define Locations). The sister does
   her Field Test task here (Define Tasks), and the chain's own cameras show it on my dashboard. */
<<CheckLocation>>
$gymChain.name has turned an old furniture warehouse into something that looks like a phone ad. Everything is white, glass or brushed steel, the front desk has a wall of backlit logo behind it, and the music is the kind that never quite has a chorus. The ceiling still gives the building away: bare ducts, steel beams, and a row of small gray boxes up in the girders that nobody here has ever looked at twice.

Rows of machines run all the way to the back, most of them busy, and in the corner a smoothie bar sells drinks in colors that don't occur in nature for eleven dollars each. The girl at the desk waves me through without asking for a card. Apparently my name is on a list now.

<<CheckNPCLocation>>

